      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">See if you qualify for Down Payment Assistance.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-1">Contact Cliffco Mortgage today and take the next step toward homeownership.</p>
      </div>
